<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">T<span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">hank you for contacting us about your flight
to {!Case.Arrival_City__c}.</span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">We want all our customers to have an enjoyable
journey when they travel with us, so we were concerned to learn that your
pre-selected meal wasn’t available. It appears this was due to an error by our<b><i>&nbsp;-cabin
crew/caterers-</i></b>.&nbsp;Please accept our apologies for letting you
down.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><b><i><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">-If a Frequent Flyer:-</span></i></b><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">As a gesture of goodwill, I have credited {!Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}
Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account. You can use the points towards
flights, the purchase of food and wine through Qantas Wine, or a range of
products from our online Qantas Store.</span><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><b><i><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">-If not a Frequent Flyer:-</span></i></b><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">As a gesture of goodwill, I would like to
arrange a credit of {!Case.Recovery_Quantity__c} Qantas Points to you. You can
use the points towards flights, the purchase of food and wine through Qantas
Wine, or a range of products from our online Qantas Store.</span><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">Please advise us of your Frequent Flyer number
by replying to this email, so we can credit points to your account. If you are
not already a member, you can join free of charge via our website using the following <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/discover-and-join/join-now.html/code/FAMILYFREE">link</a></span><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">We appreciate you taking the time to bring
this matter to our attention and have passed your comments to our&nbsp;<b><i>-cabin
crew/catering management-</i></b>&nbsp;to take up with the team working that
day.</span><o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: normal;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">Thank you again and I hope we have the
opportunity to welcome you on board again in the future.</span><o:p></o:p></font></p><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: white;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>